N= 100  K_norm tail (r=1e-4..1e-7): [0.0215, 0.015, 0.0105, 0.0074, 0.0053, 0.0038]
N= 200  K_norm tail (r=1e-4..1e-7): [0.0341, 0.0231, 0.0158, 0.011, 0.0077, 0.0055]
